cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this reconstruction, please cite it as below. The argument and
  the formal Lean proof archive that it reconstructs originate with Levent
  Alpöge and Claude (Anthropic); please cite Alpöge's note for the argument
  itself (see "references").
type: software
title: >-
  The Alpöge–Claude Argument for the Riemann Hypothesis
abstract: >-
  A working reconstruction of the Alpöge–Claude determinant argument from
  the readable Lean 4 refactor by Luke Sernau, colleagues at Anthropic,
  and Claude. The manuscript gives a conditional reduction of Dirichlet
  GRH to a signed determinant bound and identifies the arithmetic
  hypotheses still needed for the theta lifts.
